                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, in your Command phase, if the bearer is leading a unit that is below its Starting Strength, you can return up to D3 destroyed Bodyguard models to that unit.

