            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it and roll one D6: on a 2-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
