            <characteristic name="Capacity" id="7785-4c4f-1d4f-4b59" hidden="false" typeId="30f2-be70-861d-1b84">This model has a transport capacity of 6 ORKS INFANTRY models. Each MEGA ARMOUR or JUMP PACK model takes up the space of 2 models. This model cannot transport GHAZGHKULL THRAKA models.</characteristic>
