                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Orks Infantry^^** model only. In your Command phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield (or is embarked within a **^^Transport^^** that is on the battlefield), roll one D6, adding 2 to the result if the bearer&apos;s unit contains 10 or more models: on a 5+, you gain 1 CP.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Raucous Warcaller" id="20f6-a1fb-4f6e-f7f1" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
