                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Infantry Warboss^^** model only. At the start of the Fight phase, select one enemy unit within Engagement range of the bearer. That unit must take a Battle-shock test, and when doing so, subtract 1 from the result.</characteristic>
