                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Orks Infantry^^** model only. Each time the bearer&apos;s unit disembarks from a **^^Transport^^** after that **^^Transport^^** has made a Normal move, the bearer&apos;s unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn.</characteristic>
