                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Deffkilla Wartrike^^** model only. Each time a model in the bearer&apos;s unit makes a Consolidation move, it can move up to 6&quot; instead of up to 3&quot;.</characteristic>
